Bandit Sisters	25	{"kind":"quest","title":"Bandit Sisters","wikiPath":"/Bandit_Sisters","sources":[{"kind":"quest","where":"Northern Felwithe","detail":"Start zone"},{"kind":"quest","where":"Tynkale","detail":"Quest giver"}],"components":[{"name":"Dull Pearl Necklace","qty":1,"wikiPath":"/Dull_Pearl_Necklace"}],"rewards":[{"text":"Bearskin Gloves","item":"Bearskin Gloves","wikiPath":"/Bearskin_Gloves"},{"text":"Leather Belt","item":"Leather Belt","wikiPath":"/Leather_Belt"},{"text":"Leather Leggings","item":"Leather Leggings","wikiPath":"/Leather_Leggings"},{"text":"Leather Shoulderpads","item":"Leather Shoulderpads","wikiPath":"/Leather_Shoulderpads"},{"text":"Targ Shield","item":"Targ Shield","wikiPath":"/Targ_Shield"},{"text":"Small Leather Gorget","item":"Small Leather Gorget","wikiPath":"/Small_Leather_Gorget"},{"text":"Small Leather Mask","item":"Small Leather Mask","wikiPath":"/Small_Leather_Mask"},{"text":"Small Leather Shoulderpads","item":"Small Leather Shoulderpads","wikiPath":"/Small_Leather_Shoulderpads"}],"card":{"title":"Bandit Sisters","lines":["Minimum Level: 12","Classes: Bard, Cleric, Druid, Monk, Paladin, Ranger, Rogue, Shadow Knight, Shaman, Warrior","Related Zones: Greater Faydark, Lesser Faydark","Related NPCs: a drunkard, Jayla Nybright, Kayla Nybright, Shayla Nybright, Tayla Nybright","Minimum Faction: Indifferent"]},"links":["Felwithe","Tynkale","Bard","Cleric","Druid","Monk","Paladin","Ranger","Rogue","Shadow Knight","Shaman","Warrior","Greater Faydark","Lesser Faydark","A drunkard","Jayla Nybright","Kayla Nybright","Shayla Nybright","Tayla Nybright","Bearskin Gloves","Leather Belt","Leather Leggings","Leather Shoulderpads","Targ Shield","Small Leather Gorget","Small Leather Mask","Small Leather Shoulderpads","Mistmoore Castle","Dull Pearl Necklace","Identify","Dervish Cutthroats","Clerics of Tunare","King Tearis Thex","Princess Lenya (Quest)","Wino"],"dialogue":[{"npc":"Tynkale","text":"Hail noble, ______! Can you be of [service to the Clerics of Tunare] or are you not from our order?"},{"npc":"Tynkale","text":"That is good. Prove yourself, then. Are you [new to Felwithe] or have I been conversing with a [veteran of the good fight]?"},{"npc":"Tynkale","text":"Then stand at attention when I speak. I want you to venture to Kelethin and seek out Tandan Nybright. He is an old member of ours. He had some hardships and he fell from Tunare's grace, yet he is still a member of our family. He will be the one who reeks of elven wine. Greet him by name. We are worried for him."},{"npc":"a drunkard","text":"How did you know my name? You must be from Felwithe. .. Excuse my condition. I am not the man I once was. I have had a [shocking experience]."},{"npc":"a drunkard","text":"My daughters have become bloodthirsty bandits. They went off to visit Antonica and when they returned, they became bandits. They now attack every poor traveler who happens upon them. They have disgraced the name of Nybright. Will you [hunt the Nybright Sisters] or is this not to your liking?"},{"npc":"a drunkard","text":"I am most thankful. Many adventurers would not help me with this matter. Go and seek out the Nybright sisters. I gave each of the four a personalized necklace. Return them all to me when the deeds are done. May the Tribunal watch over you."},{"npc":"a drunkard","text":"This is a sad day, but it was the just thing to do. The Nybright name will no longer be tarnished. Here you are, my friend. This is a bit neglected, but it is yours. My warrior days are over. Now, go. I must be alone."}],"fetchedAt":"2026-09-16T08:27:15.947Z","outOfEra":false}
