Goblin Caster Necklace	25	{"kind":"quest","title":"Goblin Caster Necklace","wikiPath":"/Goblin_Caster_Necklace","sources":[{"kind":"quest","where":"Halas","detail":"Start zone"},{"kind":"quest","where":"Shamus Felligan","detail":"Quest giver"}],"components":[],"rewards":[{"text":"Gavel of Justice","item":"Gavel of Justice","wikiPath":"/Gavel_of_Justice"}],"card":{"title":"Goblin Caster Necklace","lines":["Minimum Level: 5","Classes: Shaman","Related Zones: Everfrost Peaks","Related NPCs: ice goblin caster"]},"links":["Halas","Shamus Felligan","Shaman","Everfrost Peaks","Ice goblin caster","Gavel of Justice","Ice goblin diver","Shattered Caster Beads","Caster Beads","Shamen of Justice","Merchants of Halas","Circle of Unseen Hands","Coalition of Tradefolk Underground","Ebon Mask","Hall of the Ebon Mask","Coalition of Tradefolk"],"dialogue":[{"npc":"Shamus Felligan","text":"Greetin's! Justice speaks through us. We're the followers o' the Tribunal. We act as judge, jury and executioner fer all misled Northmen. Sometimes we must also execute our swift justice upon evil races, such as th' [ice goblins]."},{"npc":"Shamus Felligan","text":"The ice goblins are a weak race. They pose no threat to our community, but lately we've heard rumors of ice goblins as can cast spells. They're said to be as weak as the goblin warriors, so I seek to employ the talents of our young shamans to [hunt the goblin casters]."},{"npc":"Shamus Felligan","text":"Aye, ye'll serve justice. I must find the source o' their recent spellcasting ability. I hear reports o' glowing necklaces upon these wicked beasts' necks. Get me one o' these casters' necklaces. Return them in any condition at all. Go! Justice awaits yer return."},{"npc":"Seamus Felligan","text":"These aren't be the beads I be lookin' for. Keep lookin' for the beads that be glowin o' bright. Take this for ye attempt o' justice."}],"fetchedAt":"2026-09-16T09:21:08.756Z","outOfEra":false}
