The Falchion	25	{"kind":"quest","title":"The Falchion","wikiPath":"/The_Falchion","sources":[{"kind":"quest","where":"Northern Felwithe","detail":"Start zone"},{"kind":"quest","where":"General Jyleel","detail":"Quest giver"}],"components":[],"rewards":[{"text":"Falchion of the Koada'Vie","item":"Falchion of the Koada'Vie","wikiPath":"/Falchion_of_the_Koada%27Vie"}],"card":{"title":"The Falchion","lines":["Minimum Level: 22","Classes: Paladin","Related Zones: Crushbone, Ocean of Tears","Related NPCs: Ambassador DVinn, Brawn, The Prophet"]},"links":["Felwithe","General Jyleel","Paladin","Crushbone","Ocean of Tears","Ambassador DVinn","Brawn","The Prophet","Falchion of the Koada'Vie","Orc runner","Black Heart","Blue Orc Head","Large Locked Crate","Clerics of Tunare","King Tearis Thex"],"dialogue":[{"npc":"General Jyleel","text":"So, the Teir'Dal are behind the recent advances of the orcs?!! Your news has shed light on their union. It is time to step forth and prove yourself a [faithful paladin of this court]."},{"npc":"General Jyleel","text":"I command you to seek out this Ambassor D’Vinn and rip his heart from his lifeless body. Next, find the supreme caster of the orcs and, finally, find the spot where supplies are dropped by the Teir’Dal for the orcs. There you should find the supply crate. Return all 3 items and you shall wield the falchion."},{"npc":"General Jylell","text":"A noble deed has been done and the alliance of evil has been stalled. I present you with the falchion of the Koada’Vie. You are now an honorable member of our order. Hail Felwithe! May you defend her with honor."}],"fetchedAt":"2026-09-23T06:44:11.674Z","outOfEra":false}
